  "scope": "Pinned linear element projection/normalization and diamond vertex conventions assist new stage code; unchanged original helpers execute only in bounded test VMs. Sub-pixel diamond vertices deliberately clamp to editor bounds.",
  "sourceAcquisitionNote": "Initial web lookups for element/points.ts and element/geometry.ts returned errors; authenticated release source map identified actual points.ts and element/bounds.ts paths. No runtime behavior threshold or source changed because of those lookup errors."
